{"id":"e491b1e5ddd077b1","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-thm-embeddings.md","title":"Embedding into a Saturated Model","display":"thm-embeddings — Embedding into a Saturated Model","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-embeddings","aliases":["58-thm-embeddings"],"display":"thm-embeddings — Embedding into a Saturated Model","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-elementary.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md]]","[[58-df-kappa-saturated]]","[[58-df-logic]]","[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-embeddings"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-embeddings</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-embeddings — Embedding into a Saturated Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e91c1261e1c2374b\" href=\"?note=e91c1261e1c2374b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-elementary.md\">../batch09/58-df-elementary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"01f4b76e2e096590\" href=\"?note=01f4b76e2e096590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md\">../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4519dfdd6e3aa4d9\" href=\"?note=4519dfdd6e3aa4d9\" title=\"58-df-kappa-saturated\">58-df-kappa-saturated</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"44e32f3fb4334e0c\" href=\"?note=44e32f3fb4334e0c\" title=\"58-df-logic\">58-df-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak C\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span>（结构谓词与底集算子，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\)</span>（可数集谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SaturatedInLanguage}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L,\\omega_1)\">\\(\\mathrm{SaturatedInLanguage}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L,\\omega_1)\\)</span>（对可数参数集的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-饱和性，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4519dfdd6e3aa4d9\" href=\"?note=4519dfdd6e3aa4d9\" title=\"58-df-kappa-saturated\">58-df-kappa-saturated</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_S\\)</span>（初等子结构与同构谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span>（句子编码与满足关系）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}embeddings}\\vdash \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A))\\land\\mathrm{SaturatedInLanguage}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L,\\omega_1)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak B\\models\\sigma)\\to\\exists\\mathfrak C,f\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak C,\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal L)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}embeddings}\\vdash \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A))\\land\\mathrm{SaturatedInLanguage}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L,\\omega_1)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak B\\models\\sigma)\\to\\exists\\mathfrak C,f\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak C,\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal L)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>逐个实现 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> 中元素的类型可构造一个初等嵌入，其像即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak C\">\\(\\mathfrak C\\)</span>；结论显式给出该像与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> 的同构见证。</li>\n<li>仅有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\equiv\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\equiv\\mathfrak B\\)</span> 不足以保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\)</span> 含有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> 的同构初等副本；目标模型的饱和性是假设中的关键条件。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hy